      <div style="background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-radius:var(--r);padding:28px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(106,191,60,.2)" class="rv"><div style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:12px">🧪</div><div style="font-family:'Baloo 2',cursive;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--green)">НПМГ</div><div style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.45);margin-top:6px">Национална природо-математическа гимназия</div></div>
